  <p><code>Chat/20</code> awaits an inbound type mapping. The stream has
  boundary-only skips for <code>Prty/0</code> and slot 13 command 50.</p>

  <p>The route dispatch table combines the slot and command to select a top-level
  type. The metadata section defines its recursive schema.</p>
